# Compact Analysis tab header

Shorten the Production/Plans selector and place the Graph and Help actions to its right.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Production and Plans remain a two-option selector with clear selected state.
- [x] The selector no longer consumes the full available width.
- [x] Graph and Help appear to the right of the selector in the same header row.
- [x] Graph and Help retain separate non-overlapping hit targets and independent pressed states.
- [x] Tapping either action cannot activate the other action or change the selected tab.
- [x] The player selector remains below the header.
- [x] The layout fits supported compact iPhone widths without clipping or wrapping.
- [x] UI regression coverage compiles.
- [ ] Focused compact-width checks pass on a functioning simulator or device.

## Evidence

- Combined the bounded-width Production/Plans selector and the two independent 44-point actions into one adaptive header row.
- Retained the player selector as the following row and added single-line text scaling for compact widths.
- Extended UI coverage to assert selector/Graph ordering and existing Graph/Help non-overlap.
- Arm64 simulator-target `xcodebuild build-for-testing` succeeded.
